{"id":"vod_md_4288","vodId":"4288","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"欢迎来到实力至上主义的教室","name_cn":"欢迎来到实力至上主义的教室","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230906-1/9fc06f04ca84f9bb78ee16ca5c0c8099.jpg"},"summary":"这个社会是否平等呢。真正的“实力”是什么？东京都高度育成高等学校。那是宣扬彻底的实力至上主义，以升学率·就业率100%而引以为豪的升学学校。升入那里，被分配到1年D班的绫小路清隆，却发现学校与实力至上主义的招牌相反，学生每个月会得到相当于10万日元、与现金同等价值的分数，在授课和生活态度方面也贯彻放任主义。在梦幻般的高中生活当中，不断地挥金如土、过着自甘堕落日子的同班同学们。但，不久他就得知了学校系统的真面目，并被打入绝望的深渊……！来自吊车尾聚集的D班的少年少女们所发现的，是世界的矛盾，还是正当的实力社会？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-06 07:50:48","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/VtEgBf3M/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/k32tZadQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/hqyma3L6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/GkzjmU8H/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/ifZk4ZFt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/zWLGoHeE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/iSXb4efT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/3jHSuxMU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/iFj0ah70/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/QaSXRDNm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/MqDeZ9Ag/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/l7PprIkL/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:40:29.279Z"}